---
---
<section class="reveal-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Experience</h2>
    <div class="glass-card p-8 mt-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-4">
            <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Business Analyst Intern</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400">Healthium Medtech Limited</p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 md:mt-0 border border-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Mar 2023 – Aug 2023</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Fixed KPI row: 70% / 60 min / 5 months -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6 reveal-stagger">
            <div class="stagger-child text-center p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-white count-up" data-target="70" data-suffix="%">0%</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Reduction in data gathering time</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stagger-child text-center p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-white count-up" data-target="60" data-suffix=" min">0 min</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Daily saved via automation</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stagger-child text-center p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">5 mo</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Internship duration</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-300 text-sm reveal-stagger">
            <li class="stagger-child flex gap-2"><span class="text-white mt-1">→</span> Automated SAP-HANA data extraction using Python, Excel &amp; SQL — cutting 70% of data gathering time.</li>
            <li class="stagger-child flex gap-2"><span class="text-white mt-1">→</span> Built real-time updating Power BI &amp; Excel dashboards for data-driven decision making.</li>
            <li class="stagger-child flex gap-2"><span class="text-white mt-1">→</span> Automated daily report mailing to all department heads via Microsoft Automate — saving 60 min/day.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
            {["SAP-HANA", "Python", "SQL", "Excel", "Power BI", "Microsoft Automate"].map(tag => (
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/10 text-gray-300">{tag}</span>
            ))}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
